      "rag": {
        "answer": "Clients verify the signature by recomputing the HMAC\u2011SHA256 hash of the **raw JSON request body** using their shared webhook signing secret, then comparing this computed hash to the value provided in the **X\u2011Signature\u2011SHA256** header. The comparison must be performed in constant time before any business logic is executed\u3010Source\u202f2\u3011. The header itself is included with every webhook delivery to enable this verification\u3010Source\u202f1\u3011.",
